menu.pf2 is DejaVu Sans Mono Regular at 30 pixels, with printable ASCII,
direction arrows and box-drawing glyphs. Its capitals are 22 pixels high and
ASCII cell width is 18 pixels. The font license is in LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.

Rebuild with grub 2:2.16-1 and ttf-dejavu 2.37:

grub-mkfont -s 30 -r 0x20-0x7e,0x2190-0x2193,0x2500-0x257f \
    -o iso/profile/grub/menu.pf2 /usr/share/fonts/TTF/DejaVuSansMono.ttf

The fixed face works with firmware-native gfxmode=auto without guessing the
actual mode from the requested mode. At 2560x1600 on a 13.3-inch screen its
capital height is 2.46 mm; at 1024x768 the existing 47-character entry fits.
The ISO acceptance check measures screenshot pixels against a 2.4 mm floor;
font metadata alone does not prove that the firmware displayed this font.
